---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

---
<Base title="About — Free QR Code Generator" description="Why we built a free, private QR code generator. Our mission: zero-upload, zero-tracking tools.">
  <section class="container" style="padding: 2rem 0;">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p>Most QR code generators upload your content to a server. We don't.</p>
    <p>This tool is built around one principle: <strong>your data stays in your browser</strong>. Every QR code is generated client-side using JavaScript. No server ever sees what you're encoding.</p>
    <p>It's free because we believe useful web tools shouldn't require accounts or payment. The site is supported by unobtrusive advertising.</p>
    <h2>How it works</h2>
    <p>The QR code standard (ISO/IEC 18004) defines a way to encode text into a 2D pattern. The <a href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/qrcode">qrcode</a> library implements this in pure JavaScript. We render the result to a canvas, optionally composite your Logo, and let you download it.</p>
  </section>
</Base>